{
  "title": "Oven Roasted Mediterranean Comte Pilaf",
  "description": "A floral and crispy Mediterranean dish featuring Comte cheese, served in a tagliere vessel, this pilaf is made with fry-grind-rice-khao-khua and is egg-free friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
